OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle,
OL,7,Fclearing during the second half of the
OL,8,Fnight. Clear spells develop by Monday
OL,9,Fmorning. Becoming breezy along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy periods with showers
OL,13,Fduring the morning. Sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping in places during the
OL,15,Fafternoon. A windy day, especially
OL,16,Falong the coast. Temperatures around
OL,17,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
