OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,7,Fcoming days. Cloudy with showers on
OL,8,FTuesday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,9,FWednesday and Thursday, though breezy
OL,10,Fat times. Temperatures around average.
